52.718">dī</span><span begin="52.718" end="53.010">dá</span><span begin="54.038" end="54.548">dī</span><span begin="54.548" end="56.785">dá</span></text><text for="L8"><span begin="58.795" end="59.119">ào</span><span begin="59.119" end="59.343">dài</span><span begin="59.343" end="59.823">tǎ</span><span begin="1:00.933" end="1:01.159">kuài</span><span begin="1:01.159" end="1:01.391">péi</span><span begin="1:01.391" end="1:01.639">wǒ</span><span begin="1:01.639" end="1:01.923">qù</span><span begin="1:01.923" end="1:02.659">duī</span><span begin="1:02.659" end="1:03.513">gè</span><span begin="1:03.513" end="1:04.533">xuě</span><span begin="1:04.931" end="1:05.441">rén</span><span begin="1:05.441" end="1:09.529">ba</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><songwriters><songwriter>昌旺</songwriter><songwriter>ChangWang</songwriter><songwriter>李洋</songwriter><songwriter>Yang Lee</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="1:09.529"><div begin="4.318" end="1:09.529"><p begin="4.318" end="9.652" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4.318" end="4.612">奥</span><span begin="4.612" end="4.806">黛</span><span begin="4.806" end="5.668">塔</span> <span begin="6.276" end="6.524">快</span><span begin="6.524" end="6.824">陪</span><span begin="6.824" end="7.056">我</span><span begin="7.056" end="7.334">去</span><span begin="7.334" end="7.768">堆</span><span begin="7.768" end="8.196">个</span><span begin="8.196" end="8.392">雪</span><span begin="8.392" end="8.638">人</span><span begin="8.638" end="9.652">吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Dear Odette, come and build a snowman with me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">オデット～♪雪だるま作りましょ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오데트 나랑 눈사람 만들자</span></p><p begin="11.804" end="17.174" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="11.804" end="12.044">或</span><span begin="12.044" end="12.456">是</span><span begin="12.456" end="12.658">跳</span><span begin="12.658" end="12.892">上</span><span begin="12.892" end="13.154">火</span><span begin="13.154" end="13.678">车</span> <span begin="14.076" end="14.316">绕</span><span begin="14.316" end="14.572">着</span><span begin="14.572" end="14.984">至</span><span begin="14.984" end="15.472">冬</span><span begin="15.472" end="15.748">跑</span><span begin="15.748" end="16.168">一</span><span begin="16.168" end="17.174">圈</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Or hop on a train, roaming Snezhnaya with glee</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">列車に飛び乗って…雪国を一周</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아님 기차 타고 스네즈나야 돌자</span></p><p begin="17.692" end="26.068" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.692" end="18.148">你</span><span begin="18.148" end="18.592">好</span><span begin="18.592" end="19.048">久</span><span begin="19.048" end="19.544">都</span><span begin="19.544" end="19.978">没</span><span begin="19.978" end="20.272">陪</span><span begin="20.272" end="20.692">我</span><span begin="20.692" end="21.126">玩</span> <span begin="21.366" end="21.808">我</span><span begin="21.808" end="22.258">只</span><span begin="22.258" end="22.686">能</span><span begin="22.686" end="23.144">对</span><span begin="23.144" end="23.484">着</span><span begin="23.586" end="23.902">鱼</span><span begin="23.902" end="24.276">唱</span><span begin="24.276" end="26.068">歌</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">It&apos;s been ages since you&apos;ve come to play, I&apos;ve been singing to the fish all day</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お魚と歌うわ～♪あなたがいないから</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">맨날 나랑 안 놀아줘서 물고기한테 노래하네</span></p><p begin="28.610" end="35.428" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.610" end="29.082">虽</span><span begin="29.082" end="29.518">然</span><span begin="29.518" end="29.990">舞</span><span begin="29.990" end="30.484">台</span><span begin="30.484" end="30.724">并</span><span begin="30.724" end="31.108">不</span><span begin="31.108" end="31.714">空</span> <span begin="32.354" end="32.526">但</span><span begin="32.526" end="32.736">你</span><span begin="32.736" end="32.932">知</span><span begin="32.932" end="33.148">道</span><span begin="33.148" end="33.562">我</span><span begin="33.562" end="34.012">总</span><span begin="34.012" end="34.258">是</span><span begin="34.258" end="34.716">很</span><span begin="34.716" end="34.936">孤</span><span begin="34.936" end="35.428">单</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Though the stage is far from empty, you know I&apos;m feeling so alone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">舞台は満席でも…あたしはひとりぼっち</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">관객이 있다 해도 나는 언제나 외로워</span></p><p begin="35.912" end="42.576" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.912" end="36.336">看</span><span begin="36.336" end="37.206">时</span><span begin="37.206" end="37.686">光</span><span begin="37.686" end="38.204">滴</span><span begin="38.204" end="38.602">答</span><span begin="39.104" end="39.906">流</span><span begin="39.906" end="42.576">转</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Just watching as the time ticks by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">時計を見つめるだけ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">시간만 똑딱똑딱</span></p><p begin="43.132" end="49.604" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.132" end="43.604">滴</span><span begin="43.604" end="44.056">答</span> <span begin="45.044" end="45.456">滴</span><span begin="45.456" end="45.818">答</span> <span begin="46.814" end="47.234">滴</span><span begin="47.234" end="49.604">答</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Tick-tock, tick-tock, tick-tock</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">チクタク、チクタク、チクタク</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">똑딱 똑딱 똑딱</span></p><p begin="50.424" end="56.785" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.424" end="50.888">滴</span><span begin="50.888" end="51.270">答</span> <span begin="52.246" end="52.718">滴</span><span begin="52.718" end="53.010">答</span> <span begin="54.038" end="54.548">滴</span><span begin="54.548" end="56.785">答</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Tick-tock, tick-tock, tick-tock</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">チクタク、チクタク、チクタク</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">똑딱 똑딱 똑딱</span></p><p begin="58.795" end="1:09.529" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.795" end="59.119">奥</span><span begin="59.119" end="59.343">黛</span><span begin="59.343" end="59.823">塔</span> <span begin="1:00.933" end="1:01.159">快</span><span begin="1:01.159" end="1:01.391">陪</span><span begin="1:01.391" end="1:01.639">我</span><span begin="1:01.639" end="1:01.923">去</span><span begin="1:01.923" end="1:02.659">堆</span><span begin="1:02.659" end="1:03.513">个</span><span begin="1:03.513" end="1:04.533">雪</span><span begin="1:04.931" end="1:05.441">人</span><span begin="1:05.441" end="1:09.529">吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Dear Odette, come and build a snowman with me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">オデット 雪だるま作りましょ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오데트 나랑 눈사람 만들자</span></p></div></body></tt>